steps.instructions:
After `state = next;`, start the new screen's music. The title loops the tune slower and lower; the game loops it as it was made:

```js
if (next === 'title') {
  music.rate = 0.8;
  music.loop();
}
```

and the same for `'play'` with `music.rate = 1;`. Set the rate first, then start it. Run it: a calm tune on the title (after your first click or key), and the quicker one when you press Enter.
